00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:32.450
Town Square.

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.670
And by that time, it was so crowded.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:36.130
Though, it was the month of March.

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:38.490
And still, there were a lot of crowds.

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:40.750
So, if you want to take a photo,

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.490
you can't take a solo photo.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:45.550
Because there are a lot of tourist crowds

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:46.650
