00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.450
And you can go to any destination.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:49.670
We went to Charles Bridge.

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.990
And Charles Bridge was teeming with people.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.250
It was so crowded that we got separated.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:55.550
My husband was somewhere else.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.370
My daughter was somewhere else.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.010
And I was somewhere else.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:58.770
So, we coordinated on the phone and got

00:02:58.770 --> 00:02:59.270
along.

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:00.490
So, please be careful.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:01.530
Prague is beautiful.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.350
But, what did we do the next day?

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:04.890
Early morning, at 6 o'clock.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.010
Yes, friends.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.950
If you want to avoid crowds and see

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.490
the place properly, then you have to do

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.350
this.
So, next day, early morning, at 6 o

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:12.850
'clock, we woke up.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:14.750
And directly, we went to Old Town.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.350
Luckily, our apartment was just 5 minutes walking

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.310
distance from Old Town.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:19.550
And it was very easy.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:20.690
The walks were beautiful.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:21.970
We woke up and left.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.430
We took a lot of photos.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.430
We saw a lot of monuments.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:28.950
And we walked till the next destination.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.470
We saw the dancing house.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.670
And then we came back.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:32.470
After that, we had breakfast.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.590
So, which saved us a lot of hassle

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.470
