00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.290
Not very cold, of course.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.830
But, very pleasantly cold.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:42.050
We enjoyed the walk.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:42.990
We enjoyed the destination.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:46.270
So, what we learnt is basically, get up

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.450
