00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:50.970
Venice is again a crowded city.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.490
Start early, as early as 6 am.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:54.890
Yes, enjoy the sunrise.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.770
You know, you will avoid the crowds.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.590
And you will really enjoy all the views

00:03:58.590 --> 00:03:59.090
