00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.970
What I am telling you is related to

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.470
currency.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.050
So, last year, when we went from Switzerland

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:30.690
