00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.010
And then we had some Swiss francs left

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:33.510
on us.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:36.430
In Venice, we didn't realize that the currency

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.850
we were exchanging, we didn't see the commissions

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:39.350
there.

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:41.570
And it was a very big mistake.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:45.070
So, whatever we gave, we got almost 40

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:45.690
% commission.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.570
And we got the rest of the money

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:48.070
in Euros.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.950
And we really regretted our decision that why

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:50.990
didn't we check the commissions.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.730
So, please, I would like to tell you

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.170
that if you are exchanging currency, then first

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:56.890
of all, check the commissions.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:00.450
Yeah, this happened with us because we generally

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:01.590
don't exchange the currency.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.030
And that's why we didn't realize.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:04.810
Generally, we always use a credit card.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.330
And whatever cash we take from here, we

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:07.790
use that.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.470
So, this was almost like a first time

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.770
where we exchanged the Swiss francs for Euros.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.450
And we ended up suffering huge loss.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.190
So, please be careful to check the exchange

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:16.690
rates.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.490
And especially the commission rates if you are

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:19.990
doing any kind of currency exchange.

